{
  "scene_id": "011_escalation_and_desperation",
  "description": "Chapter 11 escalation and desperation",
  "entities": [],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 22,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Behavioral assessment,\"",
        "line": 30
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 24,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Aggression levels: maximum, exceeding safe parameters for intra-legion cooperation. Obedience to consciousness-commands: sporadic and conditional. They parse commands for alignment with their own rage-based objectives. Cooperation with other units: minimal. They see other Dregans not as comrades, but as mirrors of their own flawed existence. Self-preservation instinct: critically degraded. They demonstrate a preference for mutually assured destruction if it allows them to inflict maximum harm on a target.\"",
        "line": 33
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 25,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Combat effectiveness against projected desert Giant defenses?\"",
        "line": 35
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 27,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Exceeds all projections. Their vocal sonic disruption is uniquely tailored to crystalline-polymer matrices\u2014the precise composition of Giant stone-flesh. Sustained exposure induces catastrophic harmonic resonance, reducing solid matter to inert glass dust. Their tail-manipulators demonstrate fine motor skills and tool-use sophistication rivaling sentient species. They can wield crafted weapons, execute complex siege engineering, and their physical strength, while smaller in stature, is hyper-dense, making them comparable to the largest Giants.\"",
        "line": 38
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 34,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Authorization granted for desert deployment,\"",
        "line": 47
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 71,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"To the deep chambers! Now!\"",
        "line": 96
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 84,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They are not here to conquer,\"",
        "line": 113
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 89,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The other tribes,\"",
        "line": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 91,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Ash Giants are being crushed by walking stone that wears their face!\"",
        "line": 123
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 114,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They are not soldiers,\"",
        "line": 155
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 119,
      "actor": "Torhh",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Can you bridge the silence?\"",
        "line": 162
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 124,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Pazuzu translated, his mathematical mind finding patterns in the raw sensory data. \"",
        "line": 169
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 126,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then they are adrift,\"",
        "line": 172
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 135,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They do not want to fight us,\"",
        "line": 184
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 137,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Queen's logic is binary,\"",
        "line": 187
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 139,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we offer them what we offered you three thousand years ago,\"",
        "line": 190
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 141,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The other tribes will see it as a bargain struck while they bleed,\"",
        "line": 193
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 143,
      "actor": "Torhh",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we must make this alliance a bridge, not a wall,\"",
        "line": 196
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 147,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we coordinate,\"",
        "line": 202
      }
    }
  ],
